= [+ parliament_heading +]

[? if opening_sejm_active : Approved simplification: August 1922 club shares scaled to 444 MPs from January, not an exact historical January roster. Campaigning changes public support, not these seats. Percentages are rounded for display. ?]

KPP: [+ kpp_sejm_display +]

PPS: [+ pps_sejm_display +]

NPR: [+ npr_sejm_display +]

PSL Wyzwolenie: [+ psl_wyzwolenie_sejm_display +]

PSL Piast: [+ psl_piast_sejm_display +]

[? if not sejm_has_chzjn : PSChD: [+ pschd_sejm_display +] ?]

[? if not sejm_has_chzjn : [+ zln_name +]: [+ zln_sejm_display +] ?]

[? if sejm_has_chzjn : ChZJN (ZLN + PSChD): [+ chzjn_sejm_display +]. The parties remain separate for government formation. ?]

[? if opening_sejm_active : Minority deputies ?][? if not opening_sejm_active : Blok Mniejszości Narodowych ?]: [+ minorities_bloc_sejm_display +]

Inne: [+ other_sejm_display +]

[? if not polish_economy_system and spd_in_government = 1 : Budget: [+ budget +] ?]

Next Sejm election: [+ pl_next_election_display +]

[? if not sejm_first_election_completed : The first Sejm election is in November 1922. It allocates 444 MPs from voting intentions; ChZJN combines ZLN and PSChD on the ballot. ?]

[? if sejm_first_election_completed and not polish_presidential_sequence_completed : In December the Sejm elects its Marshal and the National Assembly elects the President, without another monthly action. ?]

[? if polish_presidential_sequence_completed : The 111-seat Senate is derived once from the Sejm result (a simplification); it has no separate campaign. There are no early elections without a lawful act, so the next election follows the default legal calendar. ?]

Majority required: [+ sejm_majority_required +] of [+ sejm_total_seats +] MPs. Recorded votes and election history are available in the Library; polling below is not the sitting parliament.

